{"ref":"BDB, חָרֵד","hw":"חָרֵד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָרֵד</span></big>  <strong>adj.verb.</strong> of foregoing, <strong>trembling</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">חָרֵד</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:3\" href=\"/Judges.7.3\">Ju 7:3</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֵדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.5\">Is 66:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:3\" href=\"/Ezra.10.3\">Ezr 10:3</a>—<em>trembling</em> (from fear), abs. <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:3\" href=\"/Judges.7.3\">Ju 7:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ירא</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.13\">1 S 4:13</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבּוֹ</span>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>, <em>for</em>, in behalf of); in awe and reverence, at word of God, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:4\" href=\"/Ezra.9.4\">Ezr 9:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.2\">Is 66:2</a> (sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.5\">5</a> (sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בְּמִצְוַת אל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:3\" href=\"/Ezra.10.3\">Ezr 10:3</a>.","next":"BDB, חֲרֹד","prev":"BDB, חָרַד"}